aker domestic demand in the same way a fall in non-gold imports would be."},{"question":"Caveats","answer":"The latest month is a quick estimate and is revised later. The gold group is as defined by DGCI&S; it can differ from RBI or customs-duty based measures of gold inflows."}],"related":[],"layer":"added","note":"The latest month is a quick estimate and is revised when final data come in about a month later; earlier months on this page use the revised figure published in the next year's release. Gold volumes (tonnes) are not published in the quick-estimate tables.","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:29:01+00:00"}